From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] d3dxof: save side writes text files (3556)

d3dxof: the save side writes text .x files

CreateSaveObject (text format) creates the file; SaveTemplates writes template definitions for
registered templates; CreateDataObject builds a data object from a template and a packed data
buffer (checked against the template, strings copied); AddDataObject nests an object, AddDataReference
adds a { name <guid> } reference; SaveData writes the object, its children and references. Other
formats return DXFILEERR_NOTDONEYET, unknown templates DXFILEERR_NOTEMPLATE, data that does not fit
the template DXFILEERR_BADVALUE.
